not affiliated with or endorsed by Klei Entertainment.

This repository contains no file of the game: no Klei source code, game binaries, game
assets or game data. Building it needs an installed copy of the game, whose assemblies
are referenced at build time and are not copied into the output.

No third-party source code is included. The framework calls Harmony, which the game
ships; it is referenced at build time and is not redistributed here.
